# Mailer Conventions

- Provide HTML and text templates when both formats are used in production.
- Use `deliver_later` (Sidekiq), not `deliver_now` in controllers.
- Mailer previews in `spec/mailers/previews/`.
- Test with `have_enqueued_mail(MailerClass, :method_name)`.
- Keep mailers thin — formatting in presenters; from address via `MailerDefaultFrom` when applicable.
